[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4363900868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119155#issuecomment-4363900868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119155","id":4363900868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBBvXxA","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-02T13:35:49Z","updated_at":"2026-05-02T13:35:49Z","body":"It uses the result of `TileSet::generate_terrains_icons` function which indeed picks a \"most-bit-fitting\" tile as the icon.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/16bb065ac31b79c0ed24b3b944d3b5275123e854/scene/resources/2d/tile_set.cpp#L2454-L2550\n\nSuch icons produced by `TileSet::generate_terrains_icons` are used in 2 places:\n\n(1) `TileMap` dock -> `Terrains` tab|(2) `TileSet` dock -> `Tile Sources` tab -> `Paint` tab\n-|-\n<img width=\"454\" height=\"222\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/966622b6-9269-4a18-8a7d-24464d44d9e5\" />|<img width=\"494\" height=\"277\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cb358c53-f494-44b5-bcfc-2d5397c4f1c4\" />\n\nI think for (1) it kinda makes sense for the icon in the list to be \"most fitting tile\".\nBut for (2) which is being reported here I think it's a bug as it should indicate what we're painting, hence it should show the raw color assigned to the given terrain.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4363900868/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]